-cai-wu-li-xing-neng-gai-shu.html","postSourceUrl":"https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/3","commentNum":0,"wordCount":7344,"description":"![JOE](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/751d86df-ced6-4f49-8e37-0cfb1dc5f958)\r\n# 摘 要：\r\n> 在查阅国内外竹材材性研究文献的基础上,系统总结了竹材解剖、物理性质研究的进展。","top":0,"createdAt":1721001091,"style":"<link rel='stylesheet' href='./assets/journal-style.css'>","script":"<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekTOC.js'></script><script src='./assets/journal-post.js'></script>","head":"","ogImage":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","createdDate":"2024-07-15","dateLabelColor":"#bc4c00"},"P4":{"htmlDir":"docs/post/jiao-he-zhu-cai-li-xue-xing-neng.html","labels":["工学","文章","竹材"],"postTitle":"胶合竹材力学性能","postUrl":"post/jiao-he-zhu-cai-li-xue-xing-neng.html","postSourceUrl":"https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/4","commentNum":0,"wordCount":6598,"description":"![JOE](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/751d86df-ced6-4f49-8e37-0cfb1dc5f958)\r\n# 摘 要：\r\n> 随着全球工业化的发展，人类赖以生存的自然环境遭受到了严重的破坏。","top":0,"createdAt":1721002840,"style":"<link rel='stylesheet' href='./assets/journal-style.css'>","script":"<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekTOC.js'></script><script src='./assets/journal-post.js'></script>","head":"","ogImage":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","createdDate":"2024-07-15","dateLabelColor":"#bc4c00"},"P5":{"htmlDir":"docs/post/zhu-cai-gai-xing-ji-fang-fu-de-yan-jiu---bi-ji.html","labels":["笔记","竹材"],"postTitle":"竹材改性及防腐的研究-笔记","postUrl":"post/zhu-cai-gai-xing-ji-fang-fu-de-yan-jiu---bi-ji.html","postSourceUrl":"https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/5","commentNum":0,"wordCount":2398,"description":"![JOE](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/751d86df-ced6-4f49-8e37-0cfb1dc5f958)\r\n# 木材，竹材防腐常见标准\r\n- （1）GB/T 29905-2013《木材防腐剂流失率试验方法》；\r\n- （2）GB/T 40630-2021《木材刻痕防腐处理技术要求》；\r\n- （3）GB/T 13942.1-92《木材天然耐腐性试验方法》；\r\n- （4）LY/T 1283-2011《木材防腐剂对腐朽菌毒性实验室试验方法》；\r\n- （5）LY/T 3195-2020《防腐竹材的质量要求》；\r\n- （6）BS EN 113-1993《木材防腐剂：对损害木材的担子菌纲防护效果的测定试验方法 、有毒物数值的测定》。","top":0,"createdAt":1721041945,"style":"<link rel='stylesheet' href='./assets/journal-style.css'>","script":"<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekTOC.js'></script><script src='./assets/journal-post.js'></script>","head":"","ogImage":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","createdDate":"2024-07-15","dateLabelColor":"#bc4c00"},"P6":{"htmlDir":"docs/post/EPD（-huan-jing-chan-pin-sheng-ming-）-ren-zheng---zhi-nan.html","labels":["指南"],"postTitle":"EPD（环境产品声明）认证-指南","postUrl":"post/EPD%EF%BC%88-huan-jing-chan-pin-sheng-ming-%EF%BC%89-ren-zheng---zhi-nan.html","postSourceUrl":"https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/6","commentNum":0,"wordCount":7483,"description":"![JOE](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/751d86df-ced6-4f49-8e37-0cfb1dc5f958)\r\n国际EPD主页 https://www.environdec.com/home\r\n> 环境产品认证EPD（Environmental Product Declaration，也叫做Ⅲ型环境产品声明）是经由第三方验证的，科学的、可比的、国际认可的，对产品整个生命周期的环境影响综合信息披露。","top":0,"createdAt":1721092945,"style":"<link rel='stylesheet' href='./assets/journal-style.css'>","script":"<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekTOC.js'></script><script src='./assets/journal-post.js'></script>","head":"","ogImage":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","createdDate":"2024-07-16","dateLabelColor":"#bc4c00"},"P7":{"htmlDir":"docs/post/ Journal of Earth --tou-gao.html","labels":["指南"],"postTitle":" Journal of Earth -投稿","postUrl":"post/%20Journal%20of%20Earth%20--tou-gao.html","postSourceUrl":"https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/7","commentNum":0,"wordCount":1241,"description":"![JOE](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e3980da-e615-4710-a4f3-7a5eea566394)\r\n- # [Journal of Earth ](https://senkeller.github.io/Earth/)\r\n\r\n- ### [**投稿须知**](https://senkeller.github.io/Earth/post/tou-gao-xu-zhi-%20Instructions%20for%20Authors.html)\r\n- ### [**投稿入口**](https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/new)\r\n***\r\n## 常用技巧\r\n \r\n\r\n- 图片大小\r\n` <img src='  '  alt='img' width='50%'>`\r\n\r\n-  logo显示\r\n `![JOE](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e3980da-e615-4710-a4f3-7a5eea566394)`\r\n\r\n| [ 在线表格转换 ](https://tableconvert.com/zh-cn/excel-to-markdown) | [图片格式](https://www.runoob.com/markdown/md-image.html) | [表格格式](https://www.runoob.com/markdown/md-table.html) | [其他技巧](https://www.runoob.com/markdown/md-advance.html) |\r\n|--------------------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|\r\n| [ 在线表格转换 ](https://tableconvert.com/zh-cn/excel-to-markdown) | [图片格式](https://www.runoob.com/markdown/md-image.html) | [表格格式](https://www.runoob.com/markdown/md-table.html) | [其他技巧](https://www.runoob.com/markdown/md-advance.html) |\r\n\r\n\r\n- 联系我们：zzsenln@163.com \r\n\r\n。","top":1,"createdAt":1721198433,"style":"<link rel='stylesheet' href='./assets/journal-style.css'>","script":"<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekTOC.js'></script><script src='./assets/journal-post.js'></script>","head":"","ogImage":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","createdDate":"2024-07-17","dateLabelColor":"#bc4c00"},"P8":{"htmlDir":"docs/post/ping-heng-han-shui-lv-de-ying-xiang.html","labels":["文章","竹材"],"postTitle":"平衡含水率的影响","postUrl":"post/ping-heng-han-shui-lv-de-ying-xiang.html","postSourceUrl":"https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/8","commentNum":0,"wordCount":926,"description":"![JOE](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/751d86df-ced6-4f49-8e37-0cfb1dc5f958)\r\n#  **平衡含水率对竹材性能的影响**\r\n平衡含水率是指材料在特定环境条件下，其内部水分与外部环境达到动态平衡时的水分含量。","top":0,"createdAt":1721211788,"style":"<link rel='stylesheet' href='./assets/journal-style.css'>","script":"<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekTOC.js'></script><script src='./assets/journal-post.js'></script>","head":"","ogImage":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","createdDate":"2024-07-17","dateLabelColor":"#bc4c00"},"P9":{"htmlDir":"docs/post/zhu-cai-lie-hua-——-bi-ji.html","labels":["笔记","竹材"],"postTitle":"竹材劣化——笔记","postUrl":"post/zhu-cai-lie-hua-%E2%80%94%E2%80%94-bi-ji.html","postSourceUrl":"https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/9","commentNum":0,"wordCount":2126,"description":"![JOE](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e3980da-e615-4710-a4f3-7a5eea566394)\r\n# 竹材霉变\r\n **劣化形式** | **劣化因子** | **表现方式**                      | **劣化机制**                               \r\n----------|----------|-------------------------------|----------------------------------------\r\n 光老化  | 紫外光、水分   | 表面变色、光泽度降低、粗糙度增大、 径向劈裂、机械性能下降 | 纤维素、半纤维素和木质素的光降解（主要为木质素）               \r\n 湿热老化 | 水分、温度    | 开裂、变形、材质软化、力学性能下降             | 水分子进出细胞壁使竹材发生干缩湿胀，以及高温条件下半纤维素的热解和纤维的软化 \r\n 霉变 | 霉菌       | 污染天然材色、降低表面质量                 | 消耗细胞腔内的营养物质，产生有色孢子，部分霉菌还可以分色素          \r\n 腐朽   | 褐腐菌      | 材色变褐、纵向开裂、力学性能下降              | 基于芬顿反应的降解，以及纤维素和半纤维素的酶降解               \r\n 腐朽   | 腐菌       | 材色变白、降解后成海绵状团块、力学 性能下降        | 纤维素、半纤维素和木质素的同步酶降解 （主要为木质素）            \r\n\r\n# 竹材湿热老化\r\n当外界温湿度条件发生变化时，竹材能相应地从环境中吸收或释放水分，且对水分的吸收作用从表面向内部逐渐降低 。","top":0,"createdAt":1721218054,"style":"<link rel='stylesheet' href='./assets/journal-style.css'>","script":"<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekTOC.js'></script><script src='./assets/journal-post.js'></script>","head":"","ogImage":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","createdDate":"2024-07-17","dateLabelColor":"#bc4c00"},"P10":{"htmlDir":"docs/post/ren-zao-ban-jiao-nian-ji.html","labels":["文章","人造板","胶黏剂"],"postTitle":"人造板胶黏剂","postUrl":"post/ren-zao-ban-jiao-nian-ji.html","postSourceUrl":"https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/10","commentNum":0,"wordCount":9122,"description":"![JOE](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/751d86df-ced6-4f49-8e37-0cfb1dc5f958)\r\n# 1 前言\r\n\r\n> 利用各项生物质的资源进行产品加工与制造，用以代替木材、水泥等材料使其成为新型的环保可循环材料。","top":0,"createdAt":1721219209,"style":"<link rel='stylesheet' href='./assets/journal-style.css'>","script":"<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekTOC.js'></script><script src='./assets/journal-post.js'></script>","head":"","ogImage":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","createdDate":"2024-07-17","dateLabelColor":"#bc4c00"},"P11":{"htmlDir":"docs/post/wei-bo-gu-hua-huan-yang-shu-zhi---xue-xi-bi-ji.html","labels":["笔记","树脂","胶黏剂"],"postTitle":"微波固化环氧树脂-学习笔记","postUrl":"post/wei-bo-gu-hua-huan-yang-shu-zhi---xue-xi-bi-ji.html","postSourceUrl":"https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/11","commentNum":0,"wordCount":3573,"description":"![JOE](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e3980da-e615-4710-a4f3-7a5eea566394)\r\n# 1 微波固化的原理\r\n对于微波固化的机理，有“致热效应”和“非致热效应”两种解释。","top":0,"createdAt":1721306898,"style":"<link rel='stylesheet' href='./assets/journal-style.css'>","script":"<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekTOC.js'></script><script src='./assets/journal-post.js'></script>","head":"","ogImage":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","createdDate":"2024-07-18","dateLabelColor":"#bc4c00"},"P12":{"htmlDir":"docs/post/jiao-nian-ji-kai-fa-she-ji-yuan-li---bi-ji.html","labels":["笔记","胶黏剂"],"postTitle":"胶黏剂开发设计原理-笔记","postUrl":"post/jiao-nian-ji-kai-fa-she-ji-yuan-li---bi-ji.html","postSourceUrl":"https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/12","commentNum":0,"wordCount":5635,"description":"![JOE](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e3980da-e615-4710-a4f3-7a5eea566394)　　\r\n胶黏剂的定义：通过界面的粘附和物质的内聚等作用，能使两种或两种以上的制件或材料连接在一起的天然的或合成的、有机的或无机的一类物质，统称为胶黏剂(adhesive)又叫粘合剂，习惯上称为胶。","top":0,"createdAt":1721347760,"style":"<link rel='stylesheet' href='./assets/journal-style.css'>","script":"<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekTOC.js'></script><script src='./assets/journal-post.js'></script>","head":"","ogImage":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","createdDate":"2024-07-19","dateLabelColor":"#bc4c00"},"P13":{"htmlDir":"docs/post/shi-yan-fang-an-ji-si-lu-shou-ji---bi-ji.html","labels":["笔记"],"postTitle":"实验方案及思路收集-笔记","postUrl":"post/shi-yan-fang-an-ji-si-lu-shou-ji---bi-ji.html","postSourceUrl":"https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/13","commentNum":0,"wordCount":7587,"description":"# 木材表面性质\r\n> 杨木和杉木木材经过不同温度处理后，其总表面自由能和非极性表面自由能都随着处理温度的升高而下降，而极性自由能则有不同程度的升高。","top":0,"createdAt":1721432255,"style":"<link rel='stylesheet' href='./assets/journal-style.css'>","script":"<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekTOC.js'></script><script src='./assets/journal-post.js'></script>","head":"","ogImage":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","createdDate":"2024-07-20","dateLabelColor":"#bc4c00"},"P14":{"htmlDir":"docs/post/xian-wei-su-gai-xing---bi-ji.html","labels":["笔记","胶黏剂"],"postTitle":"纤维素改性-笔记","postUrl":"post/xian-wei-su-gai-xing---bi-ji.html","postSourceUrl":"https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/14","commentNum":0,"wordCount":5249,"description":"![JOE](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e3980da-e615-4710-a4f3-7a5eea566394)　\r\n# 纤维素改性\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2eecb5e6-6658-4853-96d3-463701e37c3d)\r\n\r\n## 氨化\r\n> 氨基化纳米纤维素，又称胺化纳米纤维素，是通过将含有氨基的化合物交联到纳米纤维素表面得到的功能化纤维\r\n\r\n> [!TIP]\r\n>由于氨基带有正电荷，所以氨基改性后的纳米纤维素分子表面大都显正电；同时，氨基可以增强纤维素与金属离子的络合能力，这都有利于增强纳米纤维素与细菌的结合力。","top":0,"createdAt":1721440458,"style":"<link rel='stylesheet' href='./assets/journal-style.css'><style>.markdown-alert{padding:0.5rem 1rem;margin-bottom:1rem;border-left:.25em solid var(--borderColor-default,var(--color-border-default));}.markdown-alert .markdown-alert-title 