SourceUrl":"https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/29","commentNum":0,"wordCount":957,"description":"# 脲醛树脂固化剂体系\r\n\r\n## 固化原理\r\n\r\n脲醛树脂（UF树脂）的固化主要是通过降低树脂体系的pH值来增强酸性，从而实现固化。","top":0,"createdAt":1731308679,"style":"<link rel='stylesheet' href='./assets/journal-style.css'>","script":"<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekTOC.js'></script><script src='./assets/journal-post.js'></script>","head":"","ogImage":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","createdDate":"2024-11-11","dateLabelColor":"#bc4c00"},"P30":{"htmlDir":"docs/post/dian-fen---niao-quan-shu-zhi-jiao-zhan-ji.html","labels":["笔记","树脂","胶黏剂"],"postTitle":"淀粉/脲醛树脂胶粘剂","postUrl":"post/dian-fen---niao-quan-shu-zhi-jiao-zhan-ji.html","postSourceUrl":"https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/30","commentNum":0,"wordCount":1955,"description":"# 普通玉米淀粉/脲醛树脂胶粘剂体系热力学相容性\r\n\r\n## 热力学相容性原因\r\n\r\n- 普通玉米淀粉与脲醛树脂之间的热力学相容性较高。","top":0,"createdAt":1731311138,"style":"<link rel='stylesheet' href='./assets/journal-style.css'>","script":"<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekTOC.js'></script><script src='./assets/journal-post.js'></script>","head":"","ogImage":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","createdDate":"2024-11-11","dateLabelColor":"#bc4c00"},"P31":{"htmlDir":"docs/post/yin-li-zi-gai-xing-yi-ji-yang-li-zi-gai-xing.html","labels":["笔记"],"postTitle":"阴离子改性以及阳离子改性","postUrl":"post/yin-li-zi-gai-xing-yi-ji-yang-li-zi-gai-xing.html","postSourceUrl":"https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/31","commentNum":0,"wordCount":1086,"description":"# 纤维素和木材表面的电荷特性\r\n\r\n纤维素和木材表面通常带有负电荷，原因如下：\r\n\r\n- **羟基离解**：纤维素分子中的羟基（-OH）在水中容易发生部分离解，形成负电荷。","top":0,"createdAt":1731312149,"style":"<link rel='stylesheet' href='./assets/journal-style.css'>","script":"<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekTOC.js'></script><script src='./assets/journal-post.js'></script>","head":"","ogImage":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","createdDate":"2024-11-11","dateLabelColor":"#bc4c00"},"P32":{"htmlDir":"docs/post/yi-ge-ling-ji-chu-xiao-bai-de-zhen-shi-xue-xi-ji-lu--① AI -shi-dai-de-ruan-jian-kai-fa-xin-si-wei.html","labels":["Vibe coding"],"postTitle":"一个零基础小白的真实学习记录-① AI 时代的软件开发新思维","postUrl":"post/yi-ge-ling-ji-chu-xiao-bai-de-zhen-shi-xue-xi-ji-lu--%E2%91%A0%20AI%20-shi-dai-de-ruan-jian-kai-fa-xin-si-wei.html","postSourceUrl":"https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/32","commentNum":0,"wordCount":4351,"description":"# ① AI 时代的软件开发新思维\n\n> 一个零基础小白的真实学习记录\n>\n> 阅读时间：约 12 分钟\n> 难度：★☆☆☆☆（完全零基础友好）\n\n---\n\n## 写在前面：这篇文章是给谁看的？\n\n如果你符合以下任意一条，这篇文章就是为你写的：\n\n- 你完全没学过编程，但想自己做一个 App\n- 你用过 ChatGPT 写代码，但出来的东西总是'能用但不好用'\n- 你听说过 Vibecoding（用 AI 哼着歌就把代码写了），但试了几次发现代码越改越乱\n- 你想知道 AI 时代学软件开发，到底该学什么、怎么学\n\n这篇文章整理自我和 AI 助手的真实对话记录。","top":0,"createdAt":1781257468,"style":"<link rel='stylesheet' href='./assets/journal-style.css'>","script":"<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekTOC.js'></script><script src='./assets/journal-post.js'></script>","head":"","ogImage":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","createdDate":"2026-06-12","dateLabelColor":"#1f883d"},"P33":{"htmlDir":"docs/post/② -ruan-jian-jia-gou-ru-men-：-cong-san-ceng-jia-gou-dao- DDD.html","labels":["Vibe coding"],"postTitle":"② 软件架构入门：从三层架构到 DDD","postUrl":"post/%E2%91%A1%20-ruan-jian-jia-gou-ru-men-%EF%BC%9A-cong-san-ceng-jia-gou-dao-%20DDD.html","postSourceUrl":"https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/33","commentNum":0,"wordCount":4459,"description":"# ② 软件架构入门：从三层架构到 DDD\n\n> 零基础也能懂的架构课——用厨房比喻讲清楚所有概念\n>\n> 阅读时间：约 15 分钟\n> 难度：★★☆☆☆（需要耐心，但不需要代码基础）\n\n---\n\n## 这篇文章是给谁看的？\n\n- 你让 AI 写过代码，但出来的东西'浑成一坨'，改一个功能炸三个地方\n- 你听说过'分层架构'、'MVVM'、'DDD'这些词，但不知道它们是什么意思\n- 你希望 AI 生成的代码结构清晰、容易修改，而不是一锅粥\n- 你想知道：不同大小的项目，到底该用什么架构？\n\n如果你中了任何一条，这篇文章就是给你写的。","top":0,"createdAt":1781258846,"style":"<link rel='stylesheet' href='./assets/journal-style.css'>","script":"<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekTOC.js'></script><script src='./assets/journal-post.js'></script>","head":"","ogImage":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","createdDate":"2026-06-12","dateLabelColor":"#1f883d"},"P34":{"htmlDir":"docs/post/③ UI -she-ji-ti-xi-shi-zhan-：-cong- Design Token -dao-zu-jian-ku.html","labels":["Vibe coding"],"postTitle":"③ UI 设计体系实战：从 Design Token 到组件库","postUrl":"post/%E2%91%A2%20UI%20-she-ji-ti-xi-shi-zhan-%EF%BC%9A-cong-%20Design%20Token%20-dao-zu-jian-ku.html","postSourceUrl":"https://github.com/Senkeller/Earth/issues/34","commentNum":0,"wordCount":4759,"description":"# ③ UI 设计体系实战：从 Design Token 到组件库\n\n> AI 生成的 UI 为什么总是'蓝紫色 + 奇怪图标'？怎么让它看起来像一个真正的产品？\n>\n> 阅读时间：约 14 分钟\n> 难度：★★☆☆☆（没经验也能看懂，但需要耐心）\n\n---\n\n## 这篇文章是给谁看的？\n\n- AI 给你写的界面总是'一眼 AI'——蓝紫色调、奇怪图标、到处都是边框线\n- 你翻来覆去跟 AI 说'好看一点'，但它就是改不好\n- 同一个 App 里，A 页面圆角 8px、B 页面圆角 16px，看起来不像同一个产品\n- 你想知道专业的 UI 设计师是怎么保证所有页面风格统一的\n\n恭喜你，你说的所有问题，都有一个共同的解法——**UI 设计体系**。","top":0,"createdAt":1781259043,"style":"<link rel='stylesheet' href='./assets/journal-style.css'>","script":"<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekTOC.js'></script><script src='./assets/journal-post.js'></script>","head":"","ogImage":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","createdDate":"2026-06-12","dateLabelColor":"#1f883d"}},"singeListJson":{},"labelColorDict":{"documentation":"#0075ca","duplicate":"#cfd3d7","enhancement":"#a2eeef","ESP32":"#ABC839","Vibe coding":"#0076c4","人造板":"#0e8a16","工学":"#008672","指南":"#e4e669","文章":"#d876e3","理学":"#7057ff","笔记":"#23167C","通知":"#d73a4a","胶黏剂":"#d876e3","树脂":"#f26419","竹材":"#0e8a16","阻燃":"#d73a4a"},"displayTitle":"Journal of Earth","faviconUrl":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","ogImage":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d046a80-cbc8-4d9e-8293-3a6e18a7d590","primerCSS":"<link hre